   - Hoisting of path[i][k] out of the j-loop to avoid redundant loads.
   - Blocking (tiling) the j-loop with FW_BLOCK_SIZE to improve temporal
     locality for path[i][*] and path[k][*] within each (i, k) pair.
   - OpenMP parallelization over the i-loop for each fixed k, with a
     single parallel region covering all k iterations to avoid repeated
